# Use LF line endings for text files in the repository and working tree to prevent false modified reports and blocked rebases caused by Windows autocrlf
# The repository already uses LF; this rule keeps the working tree on LF too, so git no longer reports false changes due to CRLF differences
# text=auto lets git detect text and binary files automatically (binary files are not normalized); eol=lf forces checkout to write LF
* text=auto eol=lf
